What does “Deploy” mean?

Right now, your AI agent is in the development/testing stage inside Google Cloud Agent Platform Studio.

Before Deploy
You → Agent Platform Studio → Test your AI Agent

Only you are currently testing and configuring it.

==========

After Deploy 🚀
User / Application
        ↓
Google Cloud Agent Platform
        ↓
Your Business Consultant AI Agent
        ↓
Gemini + Google Search + Tools
        ↓
Business Analysis & Recommendations

Deploying means publishing/running your agent as a cloud service so it can be used outside this testing screen.

=========

Later, you can connect it to:

🌐 Your website
💬 A chatbot application
📱 Mobile app
🐍 Python application
🔌 API
🤖 Other AI agents / multi-agent systems

========

Deploy does NOT mean your agent becomes publicly visible automatically

It simply creates a running deployment of your agent in Google Cloud. Access and integration depend on the deployment settings and how you use the generated code/API.


===========

